{"steam_appid":2860020,"steam_name":"Doors of Insanity: ReOpened","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2860020/828900/32aca4f65a82a166e71b92ad847ab4dd3bc6350a/1750948259/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740102434","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098335/ef1965666645b019d698371848ec9dfde8502a1f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740102434","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/ss_958f0eff5b82a7ad0af98769ef0526c1206a5ce3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779870233","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/ss_516f30464d5aa411beb685f530d947bd72122f39.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779870233","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/ss_0761d3612606a8dc32ce7f4a9136ddb99d643746.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779870233","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/ss_0a41899718abb31da3f16e224f5f99df35af74b5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779870233","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/ss_7d32e3d0ca58a0ae44c833e51cd7881d3840cb9c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779870233"],"about_the_game":"<strong><i>You are trapped in the absurd and endless maze of doors that is Purgatory… and it’s time to get out. Each door could hide a mad monster, a mythic weapon, or worst of all… a weirdo!</i></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Build a deck</strong> from over 100 cards and master ridiculous synergies: turn your enemies into gold, abuse their fragile egos while cowering behind your summons, throw food at people, and more!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/3655f7ad8bbf24f42a4b9d0be3472e7a.poster.avif?t=1779870233\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/3655f7ad8bbf24f42a4b9d0be3472e7a.webm?t=1779870233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/3655f7ad8bbf24f42a4b9d0be3472e7a.mp4?t=1779870233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fantastic equipment</strong> to boost your deck’s potential with stats like the “Man Mincer”, a saw that turns enemies into attack boosting meatloaf.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/cf28fb4e613e7754a2c24b7a55790256.poster.avif?t=1779870233\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/cf28fb4e613e7754a2c24b7a55790256.webm?t=1779870233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/cf28fb4e613e7754a2c24b7a55790256.mp4?t=1779870233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Roll diverse dice</strong> that turn your turns on their heads! Double your stats, pay the price in blood, or get a lovely foot massage.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/41242244bd2288f741dad851ae1cec32.poster.avif?t=1779870233\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/41242244bd2288f741dad851ae1cec32.webm?t=1779870233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/41242244bd2288f741dad851ae1cec32.mp4?t=1779870233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>And (of course) … a Jellybean Samurai.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/7e3d4440f834e405ce349821558f6a69.poster.avif?t=1779870233\" width=620 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/7e3d4440f834e405ce349821558f6a69.webm?t=1779870233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860020/extras/7e3d4440f834e405ce349821558f6a69.mp4?t=1779870233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reimagined. Rebuilt. Reopened.</h2><br>Somewhere between a remake and a sequel, this <strong>humble tribute to roguelite deckbuilders</strong> is a passion project from a small team within Neon Doctrine who reimagined and added their unique take to OneShark’s original creation.<br>\t<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Completely reimagined Mechanics\t<br></li><li>Over 100 new Cards with powerful Synergies\t<br></li><li>New Equipment system that affects your Cards<br></li><li>New Dice system that spices up your turns\t<br></li><li>New Enemies with devious new tactics\t<br></li><li>Full Controller Support<br></li><li>UI and Quality of Life adjustments</li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-4130<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 550 or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-2310<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 650ti or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Neon Doctrine","One Shark"],"publishers":["Neon Doctrine","Raw Fury"],"release_date":"20 Feb, 2025"}